{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本森永全新瑪莉餅乾焦糖雪糕！</p><p>森永製菓在日本便利店率先推出「砕＜MARIE＆キャラメル＞」杯裝雪糕，參考零售價為 270 日圓（含稅）。頂層放有一整塊完整的森永 MARIE 瑪莉餅乾，大家可以隨心所欲地壓碎、捏碎餅乾，再與下方的雪糕拌在一起享用。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179074807175149021_21187024376abca5a843b42.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179074807351993702_6504797416abca5aa0f430.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T06:20:12.563379+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":2,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}